{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_065_dit-title\">DiT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">把 noisy latent patch 化，以 adaLN-Zero 条件化的 Transformer blocks 作为 diffusion score/velocity backbone。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Replaces the convolutional U-Net backbone in Latent Diffusion with an isotropic Vision Transformer over latent patches conditioned via Adaptive LayerNorm-Zero (adaLN-Zero).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">加噪 latent 图像 z_t、时间 t 与可选类别/条件 c</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Noisy latent tensor z_t, diffusion timestep t, and conditioning embedding c</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">epsilon/score 参数与可选方差预测，经逆扩散得到并解码的图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Predicted noise ε_θ, diagonal covariance Σ_θ, or velocity v_θ on the latent token grid</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/html/Peebles_Scalable_Diffusion_Models_with_Transformers_ICCV_2023_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_065_dit')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_065_dit')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DiT original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/59b64107d0502a0de70e.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_065_dit\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_065_dit')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_065_dit\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">latent z0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">latent z0</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">通常由预训练 VAE 编码图像得到</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests noisy latent tensor z_t, diffusion timestep t, and conditioning embedding c and prepares initial tensor representations (latent z0).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"通常由预训练 VAE 编码图像得到\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests noisy latent tensor z_t, diffusion timestep t, and conditioning embedding c and prepares initial tensor representations (latent z0).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"latent z0\" data-node-name-en=\"latent z0\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>latent z0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">通常由预训练 VAE 编码图像得到</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests noisy latent tensor z_t, diffusion timestep t, and conditioning embedding c and prepares initial tensor representations (latent z0).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"q(z_t|z0) 生成各噪声尺度的 latent\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Forward Gaussian Noising to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"前向加噪\" data-node-name-en=\"Forward Gaussian Noising\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">前向加噪</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Gaussian Noising</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">q(z_t|z0) 生成各噪声尺度的 latent</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Forward Gaussian Noising to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"训练输入；生成从 z_T 开始\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs noise z_t within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"噪声 z_t\" data-node-name-en=\"noise z_t\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声 z_t</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise z_t</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练输入；生成从 z_T 开始</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs noise z_t within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将 z_t 分块、线性投影并加入位置编码\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Patch tokens within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Patch tokens\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch tokens\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patch tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将 z_t 分块、线性投影并加入位置编码</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Patch tokens within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"时间与类别嵌入生成 adaLN 的 scale、shift、gate\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs t / class within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"t / class\" data-node-name-en=\"t / class\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>t / class</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">时间与类别嵌入生成 adaLN 的 scale、shift、gate</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs t / class within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全局 self-attention+MLP；adaLN-Zero 条件化并零初始化残差门\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs DiT blocks within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"DiT blocks\" data-node-name-en=\"DiT blocks\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>DiT blocks</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全局 self-attention+MLP；adaLN-Zero 条件化并零初始化残差门</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs DiT blocks within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"线性头输出每个 latent patch 的噪声预测；原论文 ADM-style 配置还学习方差，epsilon 可按噪声尺度换算为 score\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs epsilon / score within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"epsilon / score\" data-node-name-en=\"epsilon / score\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>epsilon / score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">线性头输出每个 latent patch 的噪声预测；原论文 ADM-style 配置还学习方差，epsilon 可按噪声尺度换算为 score</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs epsilon / score within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用 DDPM、DDIM 等 sampler 反复调用 DiT\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SDE / ODE within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"逆 SDE / ODE\" data-node-name-en=\"SDE / ODE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">逆 SDE / ODE</span><span class=\"lang-en\">SDE / ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用 DDPM、DDIM 等 sampler 反复调用 DiT</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SDE / ODE within the core transformer diffusion backbone computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将去噪 latent 还原为像素图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies VAE decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"VAE 解码器\" data-node-name-en=\"VAE decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">VAE 解码器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">VAE decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将去噪 latent 还原为像素图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies VAE decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"最终解码结果\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces predicted noise ε_θ, diagonal covariance σ_θ, or velocity v_θ on the latent token grid via Generated Image.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"生成图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Generated Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_065_dit', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generated Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">最终解码结果</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces predicted noise ε_θ, diagonal covariance σ_θ, or velocity v_θ on the latent token grid via Generated Image.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DiT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · adaLN-Zero 条件注意力与 epsilon 预测</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Patchified Latent Diffusion Transformer Conditioned via Zero-Initialized Adaptive LayerNorm</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DiT：核心公式 · adaLN-Zero 条件注意力与 epsilon 预测\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"65\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.673789pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.463972 -69.107547 335.618992 9.673789\" width=\"335.618992pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.744351-1.042169L4.61532-1.161274C4.079348-.486346 3.960242-.377166 3.801436-.377166C3.712107-.377166 3.642629-.456569 3.642629-.555824C3.642629-.665003 3.801436-1.280379 3.970168-1.796501C4.267931-2.72949 4.446588-3.463972 4.446588-3.712107C4.446588-4.109124 4.178602-4.37711 3.79151-4.37711C3.146358-4.37711 2.441653-3.731958 1.518589-2.282847L2.70964-6.729435L2.660012-6.779062C2.084338-6.650031 1.697247-6.580553 1.101722-6.511075V-6.362194C1.151349-6.362194 1.210901-6.362194 1.270454-6.362194C1.518589-6.362194 1.766725-6.342343 1.766725-6.123984C1.766725-5.895699 1.607918-5.379578 1.528515-5.081815L.188583 0H.932989C1.330006-1.528515 1.459037-1.865979 1.856053-2.47143C2.372175-3.255538 3.047104-3.870914 3.394494-3.870914C3.543375-3.870914 3.672405-3.751809 3.672405-3.622778C3.672405-3.583077 3.642629-3.454046 3.602927-3.295239L3.057029-1.240677C2.927999-.754332 2.858521-